-- words --
A close whose payload decodes and whose role is not owner is still refused under its guard: the store holds a close, written by hand by the Goal's actor, with the role runner; hyp status lists it under refused at replay under Owner closes.
-- run --
HYP_ACTOR=owner hyp status
-- floor: contains --
refused at replay:
-- floor: contains --
Owner closes: only the owner closes a Goal; the role is runner
